  "kind": "quirk",
  "title": "CUBEKPIMEMBER validates scalar errors and numeric kpi_property text before connection lookup, returning #VALUE! for invalid text and #N/A on models without KPIs",
  "statement": "In Excel 16.0.20527, CUBEKPIMEMBER(connection, kpi_name, kpi_property, [caption]) checks scalar errors on connection, kpi_name, and kpi_property first, then validates that kpi_property is numeric (returning #VALUE! for non-numeric text such as \"1,234\" or \"<>\" before checking the connection), then checks a scalar error on caption, and returns #N/A when the connection is unknown or the workbook data model defines no KPI. All 4,294 full-bank CUBEKPIMEMBER rows match.",
  "status": "measured",
  "basis": "Measured in DnaCalc crates/calc-host/tests/fixtures/pivot_cube/oracle.xlsx (A120-A121, Excel 16.0.20527) and CalcFunc-Evidence admit2-answers-cubekpimember-enrich.json and special.json (Excel 16.0 build 20527); 4,294/4,294 full-bank rows match.",
